  "description": "LWK are delighted to present an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented two-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally positioned in the popular and well-established Beechmount development on Glasnevin Hill. Offering generous accommodation, a private rear outdoor space and the benefit of designated parking, this property will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers, investors and those seeking a convenient Dublin 9 address.\n\nThe apartment opens into a warm and inviting entrance hallway, which provides excellent storage and features solid wood flooring, an intercom system and alarm. From here, the hallway leads into a spacious living/dining room, a bright and comfortable reception space enhanced by bespoke cabinetry and storage/shelving. The separate\nkitchen overlooks the mature front gardens and provides a practical and well-proportioned workspace.\n\nThere are two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from ample built-in wardrobe storage. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the internal accommodation. To the rear, the property enjoys a spacious enclosed green space together with a patio area, providing a private outdoor setting that is particularly useful for relaxing or entertaining. The property also comes with one designated parking space.\n\nThe apartment has been the subject of a number of worthwhile upgrades in recent years. In 2019, the electrical system was updated with new sockets installed in the sitting room, an updated fuse box and new lighting throughout. A new Technotherm electrical heating system was also installed, incorporating five new radiators and a smart control box. The apartment was newly decorated upon purchase in 2019, including the painting of all rooms and woodwork, as well as the wardrobes in the main bedroom and the kitchen cupboards. A new Gard alarm system was installed at the same time. Further improvements include a new cooker fan, bathroom fan and two lights to the rear.\n\nThe annex roof was 